Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:07.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(315,456)\fad(300,300)}Southern Domain\NAllheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's why my Origin Soul guided me here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.28,0:02:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a thunder planet hidden here !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since my physical body has collapsed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and my Origin Soul was damaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:29.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need a place with abundant thunder energy in order to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did the Celestial Guard stop here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,must hide something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the Celestial Guard here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and investigate on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The thunder here is pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's very similar to my Thunder Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The might of this thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is in fact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,an opportunity for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will use this thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,to heal my Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's devouring heavenly thunder ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:53.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fiend is getting more and more terrifying !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,At this rate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,when will I ever be free !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)\pos(1502,714)}10 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just 10 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Origin Soul has completely recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,While healing my Origin Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I absorbed a massive amount of thunder energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The density of the thunder energy still hasn't diminished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might as well continue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,and use the thunder again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reforge my physical body !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although the avatar can't practice Ancient God techniques,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can still use the Ancient God Tactic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to absorb the energy of the heavens and the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and reforge my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:49.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:51.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,gather !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:13.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last time I had to reforge a physical body
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,was back in the Land of the Ancient God
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,when I barely escaped Tuo Sen alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's already been hundreds of years...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I traveled from Suzaku to Allheaven
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,and was careful at every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I still ended up losing my physical body...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I slept for a full 60 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1684,610)}60 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 60 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I drained all the thunder energy of this planet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,with the Ancient God Tactic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reforge my physical body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This body
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:38.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is imbued with thunder energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,One could say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Dao can't get rid of me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,My new body is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for the Heaven Defying Bead to absorb the Moongazer Serpent's bone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and finally be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Moongazer Serpent's bone is enormous
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,so the Heaven Defying Bead is absorbing it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Might as well use this opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to review what I gained on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,To steal the Moongazer Serpent's bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used a large number of my artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,These artifacts I got from Greed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,are an unexpected gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The soul of a Celestial Mountain is sealed inside this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Extracting souls of mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,rivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and even planets,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then wielding those souls to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,is something only second step cultivators can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Greed's hands, this mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,was enough to cut through the Moongazer Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that Greed's Divine Sense has been removed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll find some uses for it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,when facing enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my current strength, I can barely control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as long as I have this artifact,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will allow me to comprehend this spell unique to the second step
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This object is not the true Mountains and Rivers Painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rather, it relies on a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:45.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to imprint the Mountains and Rivers Dao onto the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:50.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it's a fake,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was enough to withstand the Moongazer Serpent's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an excellent defensive artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, this object
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,was damaged by the Ancient God's finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I get the chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely try to repair it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This looks just like an ordinary mortal emperor's crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,nothing about it is particularly remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it faced the Ancient God's finger head on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,without even being damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary item.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 5 gems
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,contain the 5 elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This energy isn't very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:43.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It felt like it was looking for something on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly of planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,had a Five Elements body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could this object be related to her ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greed also said that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,he used the souls of 9999 mortal emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to control this artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps only an emperor with a Five Elements body
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,can unleash its true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its materials
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,likely come from ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even the Ancient God's memory doesn't recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll decide what to do with it another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven Defying Bead...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(1660,612)}3 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only one last step
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:56.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to become its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:00.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Lin, began cultivating
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,thanks to this bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, I left the Heng Yue Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to risk seeking the Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I almost died a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have waited 1000 years
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,to complete the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:20.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This bead has accompanied me for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I still
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,know very little about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,After all those efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven Defying Bead,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,what secrets you hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This big door...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:26.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a strong pressure !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This power doesn't come from a higher realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a shudder from the depths of my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,As if before this great door, we cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,can only shatter our Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and kneel in submission,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,unable to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,The divide between mortal and immortal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The divide between the heavens and the earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:48.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kind of feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:52.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,is something I haven't felt in a thousand years !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,But my Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,can't be shaken even by Gods and Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was 1000 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,even more so !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using a door to break my Dao...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can dream on !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven Defying Bead,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter what you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who completed you !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the heavens kill someone I care for,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:18.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll slaughter the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you defy me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:24.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will destroy your defiance !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:37.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pressure has dissipated
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this giant arm has appeared once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this arm isn't an Ancient God's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be a special restriction guarding the door ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven Defying Bead was already full of mysteries
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and now, it's even more mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:56.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to test it a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the power of laws !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I try to advance by force,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be annihilated for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where does that giant door lead to ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what was that arm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven Defying Bead is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,an enormous opportunity is right before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,What did I do wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:59.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294,495)\fad(300,300)}Thunder Pool\NSouthern Domain\NAllheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:30.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The thunder energy in this pool
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:33.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,is far greater than that of the previous planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even the Thunder Beast doesn't dare to go too deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:38.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Guard me from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,such massive thunder energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:54.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no objections if you want to go in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,but could you leave me outside ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my current physical body,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,coming this far
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,is already the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The thunder here is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an excellent place to practice the Thunder Origin Spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will definitely allow me to refine origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven Defying Bead guided me here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to use me to refine origin energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Origin energy can help reopen the Heaven Defying Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:02.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The door reappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:05.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I'm still no match for this giant arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Heaven Defying Bead has summoned the door again,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:10.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,could it be that there is something
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,that can counter the giant arm in this place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now or never !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me see what lies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,behind this door !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:40.52,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(331,458)}Heaven Defying Space
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:17:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:17:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:01.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,what is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:02.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,or do you not ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:07.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then you are willing to seek the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The birth and destruction of planets,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,the reincarnation cycle of all beings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,are all manifestations of the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's enough
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,for one seeking the Dao in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:42.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to die by the sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those seeking the Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,only understand during death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of the Life and Death reincarnation cycle is the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:55.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cycle of karma is also the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mountains rise and fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,stones know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rivers flow to the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,water knows this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sun breaks through the clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,birds know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:13.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of these things contain the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But unless you become that thing yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:19.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't perceive its Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.08,0:19:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The condensation and dissipation of planets
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Life and Death reincarnation cycle are the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The peace of all beings and the cycle of karma are also the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,But what causes them to rise ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what causes them to cease ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you ever thought of that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,All phenomena in the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,originate from within oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:50.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The goal of seeking the Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to find yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This silhouette...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:43.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:47.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:52.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:52.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:59.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:59.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:02.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:08.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:08.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:13.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:13.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:17.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:17.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:21.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.87,0:05:21.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:25.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:31.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:38.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:38.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:48.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:48.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:54.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:54.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:17.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:17.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:25.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:25.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:35.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:35.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
