Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:57.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with countless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:20:58.49,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,685)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:04.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:01.81,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,705)\fad(800,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:05.25,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:04.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:10.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:08.69,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.89,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:10.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:17.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:18.17,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:17.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:23.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:23.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:30.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:30.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.57,0:21:35.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:35.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:43.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.25,0:21:43.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:47.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:47.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:51.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:51.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:57.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:57.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.73,0:22:01.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.09,0:22:01.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:04.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.29,0:22:04.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:10.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:10.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
